================================================================
0) Goal and Scope
================================================================

Primary goal:
- Make the codebase clearer and more modular while fixing the highest-risk issues found in review.

In scope:
- Fix functional and security issues identified in the review.
- Improve module boundaries in frontend and backend.
- Add missing tests around changed behavior.
- Reduce high-complexity files and duplicated logic.

Out of scope for this plan:
- Full redesign of UI.
- Full database migration framework replacement in one shot.
- Major feature additions unrelated to review findings.

Success criteria:
- Critical issues resolved with tests.
- Large hotspot files split into focused modules.
- Routing, API client, and collaboration flows are easier to reason about.
- No regression in existing flows (auth, documents, collaboration, portal).

